{"_type":"issue","id":"bdb-cek.7","title":"Recency inside a match tier","description":"Within the same match tier (exact, prefix, word, substring), a bead the owner opened recently ranks above one that was only updated. Recency never lifts a bead over a better tier; exact id still pins first. Macro blends 30% freshness decaying over 30 days (see report section 3).\nDone when: compareHits in palette-search.ts orders by tier, then recency (opened first, then updated), with new matrix cells; ranking stays deterministic; 5,000-bead benchmark stays under 30 ms per keystroke.","spec_id":"docs/reports/macro-search.md","status":"open","priority":2,"issue_type":"feature","owner":"nyashkn@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-10-30T02:55:27Z","created_by":"KN","updated_at":"2026-10-30T02:55:37Z","metadata":{"artifacts":"[{\"path\":\"docs/reports/macro-search.md\",\"label\":\"Macro search analysis\",\"stage\":\"research\"},{\"path\":\"docs/reports/search-test-matrix.md\",\"label\":\"Search test matrix\",\"stage\":\"spec\"}]"},"labels":["area:search","area:ux","component:palette"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"bdb-cek.7","depends_on_id":"bdb-cek","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-10-30T02:55:27Z","created_by":"KN","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
